## Context

PR #193 fixed the "Best overall" line to 98.8%, but three other
occurrences in the slides still say "99%":
- Line ~672: "recovers 99% of an expert inventory for $0.06"
- Line ~684: "Off-the-shelf pipeline recovers 99%"
- Line ~744: "The right methods recover 99%"

Note: lines referring to decomposed best-run (60% → 99%) are correct —
that's the single best run, not mean F1. And "precision >99%" is a
different metric. Only the three above need fixing.

## Actions
1. Replace "99%" with "98.8%" on the three identified lines

## Exit criteria
- All F1 references in slides are either 98.8% (mean) or clearly
  labeled as best-run values
